  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fact-finding visit avocado Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this fact-finding visit to Colombia is to inspire Dutch companies active in the sector of Hass-avocado in Colombia and contribute to the sustainability of this value chain. Besides, key stakeholders in the Colombian agriculture sector will participate in this trip to obtain more knowledge and awareness of relevant Dutch services and solutions. The long-term goal is to stimulate local private sector development in the avocado value chain and to look for business opportunities for Dutch companies focused on sustainable sourcing and monitoring in the avocado value chain, connecting Colombian farmers to the Dutch (and European Union (EU)) markets and consumers.</narrative>
  </description>
